---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Traces of Insight — The House of Nonduality"
  description="A growing digital garden of texts, sources, quotations and connections around nonduality, mysticism, philosophy and contemplation."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="kicker">In progress</p>
    <h1>Traces of Insight</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      From books, texts and sources, traces of insight slowly grow here:
      notes, quotations and connections around nonduality, mysticism,
      philosophy, contemplation and the question of what is real.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <article class="card">
      <h2>A living library</h2>
      <p>
        This space begins as a library: a gathering of books, texts and sources.
        But what grows here are mostly insights — living traces that branch,
        deepen and become connected with one another.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h2>A digital garden</h2>
      <p>
        The page will slowly grow into a digital garden of quotations, notes,
        concepts, examples and references. Not as a finished system, but as an
        organic network of inquiry and contemplation.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h2>Paths through the whole</h2>
      <p>
        Later, some insights will be gathered into paths: clear routes through
        the material, as if looking out from the library and seeing different
        ways leading toward the mountain.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h2>For now</h2>
      <p>
        This space is still in progress. Until it opens further, you can join a
        gathering, subscribe to the newsletter or get in touch if there is a
        text, source or trace you would like to share.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>